OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo will bring west to
OL,6,Fnorthwesterly severe gales and
OL,7,Ffrequent heavy showers or longer
OL,8,Fspells of rain. Winds gradually easing
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon with some drier
OL,10,Finterludes developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FQuite windy with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers at first. Winds continuing to
OL,14,Fease through the evening and overnight
OL,15,Fand becoming mostly dry with just the
OL,16,Fodd light shower around.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
