OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMostly dry and with some
OL,6,Fbrightness to start. Cloud and rain
OL,7,Fspread north through the morning.
OL,8,FStaying wet and windy through the
OL,9,Fafternoon and evening and becoming
OL,10,Fincreasingly windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,13,Fwindy Tuesday with showers, some
OL,14,Fheavy. Winds easing overnight into
OL,15,FWednesday, then bright spells and
OL,16,Fscattered showers. Mostly dry Thursday
OL,17,Fwith variable cloud and bright spells,
OL,18,Ffreshening winds later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
